    {
      "source": "Returns the lock used for reading.",
      "translation": "返回用于读取的锁。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>ReadWriteLock</code></a> adapter for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/locks/ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent.locks\"><code>delegate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/locks/ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.concurrent.locks 中\"><code>delegate</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>ReadWriteLock</code></a> 适配器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
