      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>ReadWriteLock</code> maintains a pair of associated <a href=\"Lock.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>locks</code></a>, one for read-only operations and one for\nwriting. The <a href=\"#readLock()\"><code>read lock</code></a> may be held simultaneously by multiple reader threads, so long as there are\nno writers. The <a href=\"#writeLock()\"><code>write lock</code></a> is exclusive.",
      "translation": "`ReadWriteLock` 维护一对关联的<a href=\"Lock.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>locks</code></a>，一个用于只读操作，另一个用于写入。多个读者线程可以同时持有<a href=\"#readLock()\"><code>读锁</code></a>，只要没有写线程存在。<a href=\"#writeLock()\"><code>写锁</code></a>是独占的。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a href=\"ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.util\"><code>ReadWriteLock</code></a> adapter.",
      "translation": "一个新的<a href=\"ReadWriteLock.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.util 中的接口\"><code>ReadWriteLock</code></a>适配器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>delegate</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>delegate</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
